ing but  in this case he realizes that he's the  one that has to go and confront it  himself so that's the role that he plays  he plays a antagonist but he's also  realizing there's something really  bigger out there  [Music]  in justice league current number one the  team goes to earth  eight with the retaliators and darkseid  follows them and on that world there is  another cosmic god on earth eight that  dark side gets into like a straight up  fist fight with and it's this really  cool fight scene with a twist that i  think when people get to it they'll be  really excited  [Music]  you

